 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Masquerade Confidence: The Conman and the Girl’s Masked Journey"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "マスカレード・コンフィデンス 詐欺師は少女と仮面仕掛けの旅をする"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Masquerade Confidence: Sagishi wa Shoujo to Kamen Shikake no Tabi wo Suru"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A man who uses masks to impersonate others and swindle money—\nThe con artist, Linus Krueger.\nObsessed with money above all else, Linus's world comes crashing down when, one day, a girl named Chronica, who can read souls, sees through his lies and steals the fortune he painstakingly amassed.\nUsing his own fortune as leverage, she drags him into a life-threatening journey.\n\nIn a modern fantasy world where bullets and supernatural powers fly—\nThe runaway adventure of two incompatible souls begins now.",
   "ja": "仮面を使い、他人を演じて金を騙し取る男。\n詐欺師ライナス＝クルーガー。\n何よりも金を追い求めるライナスだが、\nある日、魂が読める少女クロニカに嘘を見抜かれ、コツコツと積み上げてきた全財産を奪われてしまう。\nそして、財産を盾に、命懸けの旅へと巻き込まれていきーー。\n\n銃弾と異能が飛び交う近代風ファンタジー、\n相容れぬ二人の逃避行が今始まる。"
  },
